{
 "1": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Venn diagram of three overlapping circles: programming and computer science, maths and statistics, domain knowledge; data science at the centre\">\n          <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"190\" r=\"155\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);fill-opacity:.12;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"190\" r=\"155\" style=\"fill:var(--live);fill-opacity:.12;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"345\" r=\"155\" style=\"fill:var(--next);fill-opacity:.12;stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">\n            <text x=\"190\" y=\"135\">Programming and</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"153\">computer science</text>\n            <text x=\"530\" y=\"135\">Maths and</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"153\">statistics</text>\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"440\">Domain knowledge</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\".8\">\n            <text x=\"190\" y=\"174\">collect, clean, code</text>\n            <text x=\"530\" y=\"174\">patterns, uncertainty</text>\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"459\">the right question</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\">\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"112\">Machine</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"129\">learning</text>\n            <text x=\"262\" y=\"292\">Danger</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"309\">zone</text>\n            <text x=\"458\" y=\"292\">Traditional</text><text x=\"458\" y=\"309\">research</text>\n          </g>\n          <g text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"234\">Data</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"253\">science</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 1.1.1</b> The three skills of data science, after Drew Conway's Venn diagram. Each pair of circles without the third is a different field; only the centre, with all three, is data science. Notice which pair forms the danger zone.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "2": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 352\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The same railway booking as a structured table, as semi-structured JSON, and as unstructured review text, photo and voice note, with an arrow from more structure to less structure\">\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n            <text x=\"122\" y=\"28\">Structured</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"28\">Semi-structured</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"28\">Unstructured</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"40\" width=\"220\" height=\"232\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"40\" width=\"220\" height=\"232\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"488\" y=\"40\" width=\"220\" height=\"232\" rx=\"10\"/>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"22\" y=\"52\" width=\"200\" height=\"28\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft)\"/>\n          <g style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.2\">\n            <path d=\"M22,80 H222 M22,108 H222 M22,136 H222 M22,164 H222 M92,52 V164 M162,52 V164\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n            <text x=\"57\" y=\"71\" font-weight=\"700\">Train</text><text x=\"127\" y=\"71\" font-weight=\"700\">Name</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"71\" font-weight=\"700\">Fare</text>\n            <text x=\"57\" y=\"99\">12657</text><text x=\"127\" y=\"99\">Priya</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"99\">845</text>\n            <text x=\"57\" y=\"127\">12621</text><text x=\"127\" y=\"127\">Arun</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"127\">1210</text>\n            <text x=\"57\" y=\"155\">22637</text><text x=\"127\" y=\"155\">Meena</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"155\">690</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">\n            <text x=\"264\" y=\"68\">{</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"88\">\"train\": 12657,</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"108\">\"name\": \"Priya\",</text>\n            <text x=\"282\" y=\"128\">\"fare\": 845,</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"148\">\"meals\": [\"veg\"]</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"168\">}</text>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"500\" y=\"52\" width=\"196\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\">\n            <text x=\"512\" y=\"75\">Train was two hours</text><text x=\"512\" y=\"95\">late, but the pantry</text><text x=\"512\" y=\"115\">food was good!</text>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"512\" y=\"144\" width=\"62\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M516,184 L536,162 L548,174 L558,166 L570,184 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--live);fill-opacity:.5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"561\" cy=\"154\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/>\n          <path d=\"M604,166 h6 l4,-14 l6,28 l6,-22 l6,16 l6,-24 l6,30 l6,-20 l6,12 l6,-8 h18\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" opacity=\".8\">\n            <text x=\"543\" y=\"205\">photo</text><text x=\"648\" y=\"205\">voice note</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n            <text x=\"122\" y=\"222\">Same columns in</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"240\">every row</text>\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"222\">Keys label each value;</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"240\">fields may vary</text>\n            <text x=\"598\" y=\"230\">No predefined model</text>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" font-weight=\"600\">\n            <text x=\"122\" y=\"262\">SQL table, CSV</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"262\">JSON, XML, email</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"262\">text, image, audio</text>\n          </g>\n          <path d=\"M30,310 H690\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2.2\" marker-start=\"url(#m12a)\" marker-end=\"url(#m12a)\"/>\n          <defs><marker id=\"m12a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\"/></marker></defs>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" opacity=\".8\">\n            <text x=\"122\" y=\"300\">fixed schema</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"300\">self-describing</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"300\">no schema</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\">\n            <text x=\"20\" y=\"336\">More structure: easy to store and query</text>\n            <text x=\"700\" y=\"336\" text-anchor=\"end\">Less structure: needs NLP, vision, speech</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 1.2.1</b> Railway bookings in the three forms. The table forces every row into the same columns; the JSON record names each value with a key and may add a field such as \"meals\"; the review, photo and voice note hold the same kind of facts with no fields at all. Notice how the effort needed to analyse grows from left to right.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "3": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six steps of the data science process in two rows, with solid arrows to the next step and dashed arrows going back\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"m13a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n            <marker id=\"m13b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <rect x=\"20\" y=\"30\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"30\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"500\" y=\"30\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\"/>\n            <rect x=\"500\" y=\"210\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"210\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"210\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">\n            <circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"54\" r=\"13\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"54\" r=\"13\"/><circle cx=\"522\" cy=\"54\" r=\"13\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"522\" cy=\"234\" r=\"13\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"234\" r=\"13\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"234\" r=\"13\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-ink)\">\n            <text x=\"42\" y=\"59\">1</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"59\">2</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"59\">3</text>\n            <text x=\"522\" y=\"239\">4</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"239\">5</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"239\">6</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">\n            <text x=\"62\" y=\"59\">Research goal</text><text x=\"302\" y=\"59\">Retrieve data</text><text x=\"542\" y=\"59\">Prepare data</text>\n            <text x=\"542\" y=\"239\">Explore data</text><text x=\"302\" y=\"239\">Build models</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"239\">Present, automate</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" opacity=\".8\">\n            <text x=\"36\" y=\"87\">project charter: goal,</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"105\">measure, plan</text>\n            <text x=\"276\" y=\"87\">internal and external</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"105\">data; access, quality</text>\n            <text x=\"516\" y=\"87\">cleanse, integrate,</text><text x=\"516\" y=\"105\">transform</text>\n            <text x=\"516\" y=\"267\">plots and summaries:</text><text x=\"516\" y=\"285\">patterns, errors</text>\n            <text x=\"276\" y=\"267\">select, fit, test on</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"285\">unseen data</text>\n            <text x=\"36\" y=\"267\">report, dashboard,</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"285\">app, scheduled job</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m13a)\">\n            <path d=\"M220,75 H256\"/><path d=\"M460,75 H496\"/><path d=\"M670,120 V206\"/><path d=\"M500,255 H464\"/><path d=\"M260,255 H224\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:6 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m13b)\">\n            <path d=\"M60,210 V124\"/><path d=\"M300,210 V124\"/><path d=\"M540,210 V124\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">\n            <text x=\"70\" y=\"171\">refine the goal</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"171\">get more data</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"171\">fix new errors</text>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"326\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Solid: next step. Dashed: go back when a later step shows a problem.</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 1.3.1</b> The six steps of the data science process (Cielen et al.), with what each step produces. Read the top row left to right, then the bottom row right to left. Notice the dashed arrows: exploration sends you back to cleaning, a weak model sends you back for more data, and the presentation can change the goal itself.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "4": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Staircase of four analytics types: descriptive, diagnostic, predictive, prescriptive, rising in value and difficulty\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"m14a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--line2)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"250\" width=\"155\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);fill-opacity:.10;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"205\" y=\"200\" width=\"155\" height=\"130\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);fill-opacity:.18;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"370\" y=\"150\" width=\"155\" height=\"180\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);fill-opacity:.26;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"535\" y=\"100\" width=\"155\" height=\"230\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);fill-opacity:.34;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n            <text x=\"117\" y=\"276\">Descriptive</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"226\">Diagnostic</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"176\">Predictive</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"126\">Prescriptive</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n            <text x=\"117\" y=\"296\">What happened?</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"246\">Why did it happen?</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"196\">What will happen?</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"146\">What should we do?</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" opacity=\".8\">\n            <text x=\"117\" y=\"316\">reports, dashboards</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"266\">drill-down, compare</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"216\">regression, ML</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"166\">optimisation</text>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\" font-weight=\"600\">\n            <text x=\"117\" y=\"240\">hindsight</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"190\">insight</text><text x=\"447\" y=\"140\">foresight</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"90\">action</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#m14a)\">\n            <path d=\"M40,345 H690\"/><path d=\"M28,330 V60\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"365\" y=\"370\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Difficulty, data and skill needed</text>\n          <text x=\"20\" y=\"200\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 20 200)\">Value to the decision</text>\n          <text x=\"40\" y=\"40\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\">Each step builds on the one before it.</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 1.4.1</b> The analytics staircase. Each type answers a deeper question and needs more data and skill, but gives more value. Notice that the lower steps describe the past (hindsight, insight), predictive looks ahead, and only prescriptive ends in a recommended action.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "5": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 460\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tree of data sources split into primary and secondary, each source with its collection method, all feeding a raw data store followed by quality checks\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"m15a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"260\" y=\"14\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-ink)\">Data sources</text>\n          <path d=\"M360,54 V72 H180 V88 M360,72 H540 V88\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <rect x=\"20\" y=\"88\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"380\" y=\"88\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n            <text x=\"180\" y=\"109\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">Primary data</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\">collected by you, for this goal</text>\n            <text x=\"540\" y=\"109\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">Secondary data</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\">collected earlier, by others</text>\n          </g>\n          <path d=\"M32,138 V291 M32,171 H44 M32,211 H44 M32,251 H44 M32,291 H44 M392,138 V331 M392,171 H404 M392,211 H404 M392,251 H404 M392,291 H404 M392,331 H404\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\">\n            <rect x=\"44\" y=\"156\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"44\" y=\"196\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"44\" y=\"236\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"44\" y=\"276\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/>\n            <rect x=\"404\" y=\"156\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"404\" y=\"196\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"404\" y=\"236\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"404\" y=\"276\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/><rect x=\"404\" y=\"316\" width=\"296\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">\n            <text x=\"56\" y=\"176\">Survey, interview</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"216\">Experiment</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"256\">Sensor, IoT</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"296\">Observation</text>\n            <text x=\"416\" y=\"176\">Internal records</text><text x=\"416\" y=\"216\">Open data portal</text><text x=\"416\" y=\"256\">Web API</text><text x=\"416\" y=\"296\">Web pages</text><text x=\"416\" y=\"336\">Purchased data</text>\n          </g>\n          <g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">\n            <text x=\"330\" y=\"176\">questionnaire, form</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"216\">A/B test on an app</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"256\">reading every 10 min</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"296\">counts, field notes</text>\n            <text x=\"690\" y=\"176\">SQL query, export</text><text x=\"690\" y=\"216\">download CSV, JSON</text><text x=\"690\" y=\"256\">request, JSON reply</text><text x=\"690\" y=\"296\">scraping HTML</text><text x=\"690\" y=\"336\">licensed files</text>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m15a)\">\n            <path d=\"M190,308 L280,376\"/><path d=\"M550,348 L470,376\"/>\n          </g>\n          <rect x=\"130\" y=\"378\" width=\"460\" height=\"36\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"401\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Raw data store: files, database or data lake</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"440\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Check at once: accurate, complete, consistent, timely, valid, unique</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 1.5.1</b> Data sources and how each is collected. Primary sources (left) are gathered for this project; secondary sources (right) already exist. The coloured text on each row is the collection method. Notice that everything lands in one raw store and is checked for quality before any analysis.</figcaption>\n      </figure>"
}